", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153074069", "author": {"steamid": "76561198172970627", "personaname": "Drawgonian", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198172970627/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 1452, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 419, "deck_playtime_at_review": 383, "last_played": 1706322975, "avatar": "3f63fa3a023b97e5b97893968699f45ce3da0e9f"}, "language": "english", "review": "I bought the steam deck oled after seeing this game. Played risk of rain 2 a lot. \n\nThis game DOES NOT DISAPPOINT!!\n\nI feel like from all the roguelikes i’ve played Risk of Rain is peak. I mean Hades is also amazing with great story but the didference is what I like about Risk of Rain, the story is there to discover but its ALL about gameplay. Even when you die, starting another run is quick. \n\nThe game is hard, the variety is amazing, the new characters are so cool (hope they come to RoR2) and the trials are great levels to both learn the game and experiment with. \n\nThis game should have been nominated in a GOTY category. The experience is great on steamdeck.", "timestamp_created": 1701985194, "timestamp_updated": 1701985194, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153068887", "author": {"steamid": "76561198163495326", "personaname": "Pheeboid", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/zombitatosSpeedrun/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 58, "playtime_forever": 1621, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1081, "last_played": 1735083947, "avatar": "33a12bc9e8ccd7d0933040658485097a0445e07d"}, "language": "english", "review": "its ok i guess", "times